    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in the tranquil countryside of Castlerickard, this delightful three-bedroom bungalow, built circa 1968, offers spacious and versatile living on approximately 0.59 acres.\n\nFeaturing well-proportioned accommodation, the home includes two reception rooms perfect for relaxing complemented by three comfortable bedrooms and wc/shower room and a separate toilet.\n\nThe property has been thoughtfully improved over the years with pumped exterior walls, attic insulation, and double-glazed windows.\n\nA standout feature is the attached garage with a mechanics pit, providing excellent potential as a workshop, for car enthusiasts, or additional storage space.\n\nThe location is highly convenient, being just 3.7km from Longwood and approximately 18 minutes from Enfield, Trim and the M4 motorway, with Dublin approximately one hour away. Buses to Boardsmill National School and Longwood pass the door, making the property particularly suitable for families.\n\nSet on a generous site with excellent potential, this is an appealing opportunity to acquire a country home with good transport links and easy access to surrounding towns and Dublin."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nLaminate wood floor. Dado rail.\n\nSitting Room - \nBrick fireplace with open fire. Semi solid wood floor.\n\nLiving Room - \nLaminate wood floor. Stanley Super 80 solid fuel range. Hot press with copper cylinder.\n\nKitchen - \nFloor and wall units with single drainer sink unit. Plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nTongue and grooved floor. Tiled fireplace.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nLaminate wood floor. Tiled fireplace.\n\nBedroom 3 - \n\n\nInner hall - \nStira stairs opens into attic, which is insulated and with a light.\n\nShower Room - \nWash hand basin, WC, corner shower with Triton unit.\n\nToilet - \nSeparate WC.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Drainage to septic tank</li><li>Water from private well </li><li>Oil fired central heating with Firebird boiler </li><li>P.V.C. oil tank </li><li>Detached garage with mechanics pit, light and sockets, 8m x 4.85m</li><li>Double steel shed in 2 divisions 6.2m x 3.9m, 6.2m x 4.7m</li><li>Gravel driveway</li><li>P.V.C. back door</li><li>P.V.C. double glazed windows throughout </li><li>Outside light. OUtside tap.</li><li>Boiler house 4.6m xc 3m, fuel store 1.9m x 2.2m</ul>"
      },
